      <article class="feature-rule"><h2 class="font-medium text-xl">Build toward outdoor freedom</h2><p class="mt-3 muted">All-terrain readiness for active lifestyles is a development goal. Start with grass, pavement, firm trails and light gravel, then establish tested surface, slope and obstacle limits for each size.</p></article>
